A valuation without a price throws through both CLI and API.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate --value <<'LEDGER'
commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity STOCK
  format 1,000 STOCK
account Assets:Stock
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Stock  10 STOCK {10 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK
LEDGER

========== API ==========

aggregate({ inValuationCommodity: true });

========== ERROR ==========

No price for STOCK on or before 9999-12-31 can convert it to SEK
